  m_Name: EvilBusinessMan
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueObject
  dialogue:
  - Scram Kid! Can't you see I'm dumping waste here!
  - How else am I supposed to mass produce these vapes?
  - Ahhhhhhhh my two favorite things, building my fortune and eviscerating the environment.
  - Look around at all this peaceful nature... really makes me sick! I must inquire
    about building a stripmall here. Yes - that's what I'll do!
